$ jailops create web --image freebsd-15#g1 --network lan --storage default
jail/web created

$ jailops create db --image freebsd-15#g1 --network lan --storage default
jail/db created

$ jailops start web
jail/web started

$ jailops start db
jail/db started

$ jailops update list
! No resources found.

$ jailops update check
JAIL   PROJECT   MODE   AVAILABLE   UPDATES                                         CHECKED
db     main      -      yes         os freebsd-15#g1 -> freebsd-15#g2               3h
web    main      -      yes         2 packages, os freebsd-15#g1 -> freebsd-15#g2   3h

